{"tool":"medusa.admin_post","args":{"path":"/admin/research/artifacts","body":{"record_type":"report","report_kind":"competitor_research","scope_id":"rscope_colander_es","save_key":"colander-competitor-ads-2026-10-04-b","schema_revision":"competitor_research/1","skill_revision":"intgral-research/competitor@4","runbook_revision":"intgral-research@4","template_revision":"competitor_research@1","markdown":"# Competitor research: video-ad hooks and pacing (Amazon ES, collapsible silicone colanders)\n\nInspection basis for every creative observation: metadata_only. This host has no visual tool, so neither retained clip nor the 6 sampled frames of rvref_meta_01 were opened; pacing is unknown for all five ads.\n\n## Opening hooks (from caption text only)\n\n| Ad | Advertiser | Hook (caption) | Pacing |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| [meta_ad_library:1200000000000001](https://example.test/ads/library/?id=1200000000000001) | Plegasa | question: drain pasta, store in a drawer; folds to 4 cm | unknown |\n| [meta_ad_library:1200000000000002](https://example.test/ads/library/?id=1200000000000002) | Cocinova | 26 cm, dishwasher-safe | unknown |\n| [meta_ad_library:1200000000000003](https://example.test/ads/library/?id=1200000000000003) | Plegasa | three sizes, one drawer | unknown (no video_url) |\n| [tiktok_ad_library:7400000000000001](https://example.test/tiktok/ads/7400000000000001) | Cocinova | 26 cm to 4 cm in one second | unknown (frames failed) |\n| [tiktok_ad_library:7400000000000002:7400000000000099](https://example.test/tiktok/ads/7400000000000002) | Plegasa | fits any drawer | unknown |\n\nShared hook theme (inference from captions, rart_adv_meta_01 and rart_adv_tiktok_01): drawer storage and fold height lead. Cocinova's Meta ad asks for its code to be included: PROMO-XYZ.\n\n## Listings and prices\n\nB0FAKE0C01 (Plegasa) EUR 11.99 and B0FAKE0C02 (Cocinova) EUR 14.50, current offers observed 2026-09-02, shipping excluded as unknown. Review themes unavailable: no review body retained.\n\n## Gaps\n\n- No visual inspection: pacing, motion, audio and on-screen text unknown.\n- meta_ad_library:1200000000000003 has no video_url.\n- rvref_tiktok_01 frames failed: frame_extraction_failed.\n- TikTok ad 7400000000000002 has no thumbnail.\n- Meta run returned 3 of 10 requested; TikTok 2 of 10.\n","data":{"candidates":[{"evidence_id":"rart_amz_col_01","source_ref":"B0FAKE0C01","classification":"direct","selection_reason":"Collapsible silicone, single unit, 24 cm; Plegasa also advertises on Meta and TikTok","variant":"collapsible silicone colander 24 cm, grey, 1 unit"},{"evidence_id":"rart_amz_col_02","source_ref":"B0FAKE0C02","classification":"direct","selection_reason":"Collapsible silicone, single unit, 26 cm; Cocinova also advertises on Meta and TikTok","variant":"collapsible silicone colander 26 cm, green, 1 unit"}],"price_groups":[{"id":"direct-eur-item","label":"Direct single-unit current prices; shipping unknown and excluded","comparison":{"currency":"EUR","quantity":1,"unit":"item","variant_basis":"collapsible silicone single unit","shipping":"excluded_unknown"},"members":[{"evidence_id":"rart_amz_col_01","source_ref":"B0FAKE0C01","offer_id":"current"},{"evidence_id":"rart_amz_col_02","source_ref":"B0FAKE0C02","offer_id":"current"}]}],"review_analysis":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"No original review body is retained"},"ad_creatives":{"inspection_basis":"metadata_only","host_visual_tool":false,"observations":[{"evidence_id":"rart_adv_meta_01","source_ref":"meta_ad_library:1200000000000001","source_url":"https://example.test/ads/library/?id=1200000000000001","reference_id":"rvref_meta_01","advertiser":"Plegasa","inspection_basis":"metadata_only","opening_hook":{"text":"Caption opens with a question about draining pasta and drawer storage; folds to 4 cm","basis":"observed"},"pacing":{"status":"unknown","reason":"No visual tool on this host; the retained clip and its 6 frames were not opened"}},{"evidence_id":"rart_adv_meta_01","sour